    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You know how to stay mobile, making it harder for your enemies to hit you with their attacks.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dodge\" title=\"Dodge\">Dodge</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> If you end your turn at least 3 squares away from where you started, you gain a +1 dodge bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> until the start of your next turn.</p>",
